prompt:
Write a product listing for an online store ({{marketplace}}).

Product: {{product}}
Specs: {{specs}}
Target customer: {{audience}}

Return, in American English:
1. A title under 150 characters, main keyword first, no promotional claims ("best", "#1")
2. Five bullet points, each starting with a short benefit in capitals followed by the supporting spec
3. A 150 to 200 word description in plain, concrete language
4. Five search terms customers would type, comma-separated

Use U.S. units (inches, pounds, °F). Do not invent any feature that is not in the specs.
